
PRMAIL(1)           UNIX Programmer's Manual            PRMAIL(1)

NAME
     prmail - print out mail in the post office

SYNOPSIS
     prmail [ user ... ]

DESCRIPTION
     _P_r_m_a_i_l prints the mail which waits for you, or the specified
     user, in the post office.  The mail is not disturbed.

FILES
     /usr/spool/mail/*   post office

SEE ALSO
     from(1), Mail(1), mail(1)

